      "customfield_10012" : "0|i002ev:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "[[[ OLD SUGGESTION]]]",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "•\tCALLBACK REGISTRY",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "/*",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "Defining a list of callbacks assocaited with some other objects is common practice.",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "Implementers have to create a list of the shared objects, and provide an API to add",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "and remove them. This utility class is meant to just wrap that code - so its",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "shared implemenation. Its just a private re-usable utlity.",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "It also works if you want to call the callbacks direactly and synchonously, or",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "via some kind of Q like a threadpool.",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : " */",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "template\t<typename Args...>",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "class\tCallbackRegistry {",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "public:",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "     class Connection;",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "public:",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "\t// Add the given callback to our list, so subsequent calls to Call()",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "\t// will forward the message to all registered callbacks",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "\tConnection AddCallback (std::function<void(Args)> cb);",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "public:",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "\tvoid RemoveCallback (Connection c);",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "bulletList"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "\t",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "public:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "// sends the args to each callback. if any callback throws, the remaining ones",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "// are not notified, and the exception is propagated",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "void\tCall (Args ...);",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "public:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "// example usage",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "// \tThreadPool tp;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "//\tcbRegistry.CallViaDispatcher ([tp] (IRunnablePtr r) { to.AddTask (r);}, args);",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "//",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "template\t<typename ENQUE_RUNNABLE_PROC>",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "void CallViaDispatcher (ENQUE_RUNNABLE_PROC tp, Args...) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "{",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "for (auto i : fList) {",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "ENQUE_RUNNABLE_PROC (mkIRunnable ([i, Args] () { i (Args); });",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "}",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "}",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "private:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "list <shared_ptr< std::function<void(Args)>)> > fList;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "};",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "class CallbackRegistry::Connection {",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "private:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Connection(list <shared_ptr< std::function<void(Args)>);> >::iterator);",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "list <shared_ptr< std::function<void(Args)>);> >::iterator fIt;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "...",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "};",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "[[NOTE}]] NOT sure if this is useful or not.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But - the class I created - Function<> is closely related. It helps this alot and maybe makes it needless.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
